{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1063341/block/singleImage/3264885/df/01M762423BHKP7WDBGB06M5KC1.jpg?updatedAt=1794448594\"/><figcaption>李嘉誠</figcaption></figure><p>組織碎化技術(Histotripsy)無創手術過去兩年在香港已治療逾400名病人。繼推動肝腫瘤治療及胰臟腫瘤臨床試驗，李嘉誠將向香港中文大學醫院、港怡醫院和養和醫院，提供30個腎臟癌治療臨床試驗名額，令香港成為亞洲首個推行Histotripsy腎臟癌臨床試驗的城市。 至於早前已開始、以Histotripsy進行的胰臟癌臨床試驗，港怡醫院和中大醫院至今已分別完成20宗及6宗胰臟腫瘤個案。連同香港個案，全球現累積過百宗胰臟癌臨床試驗個案及仿單外手術。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:23:55.717872+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T18:57:40.094475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:17:15.677141+00:00","content_hash":"7e40f5068d3c884a92747fffa82f99b38c5603a88d0d521109fea76b295d74d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:23:55.717872+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}